content.text:
From the existing file headers — I’m not inventing them.

Example from `AustrianRocks/Models/Boulder.swift` before edit:

```swift
//  Created by Nicolas Mondollot on 07/02/2026.
//  Copyright © 2026 Nicolas Mondollot. All rights reserved.
```

Per the plan, I replaced only the stale app header and changed the “Created by…” line into provenance text, while preserving the existing copyright line/date:

```swift
//  Originally created for Boolder by Nicolas Mondollot.
//  Copyright © 2026 Nicolas Mondollot. All rights reserved.
```

So the 2026 dates were already in the repository.

